# agentd.crontab for the disk profile (J10).
#
# Identical to internal/config/cron.go's defaultCronFile except for the
# disk-watchdog cadence, which is shortened from "*/10 * * * *" to
# "@every 5s" so the J10 journey observes a watchdog pass (and its dedup
# on the following pass) within seconds instead of waiting up to 10
# minutes. Without this the disk watchdog is untestable in an e2e run.
#
# The cadence is read from this file, NOT from config.disk.yaml — there is
# no `disk.check_interval` config key; see internal/config/cron.go's
# applyCronJob and internal/config/runtime_controls.go's DiskConfig (which
# only carries FreeThresholdPercent).
#
# @every <duration> <job>    (robfig/cron descriptor, sub-minute)
# m h dom mon dow <job>      (Vixie crontab, minute resolution)

@every 3s       task-dispatch
@every 5s       intake
@every 30s      heartbeat
@every 5s       disk-watchdog
@every 1m       hitl-reconcile
0 * * * *       memory-curator
